Decisions Made
ECS Fargate (serverless containers) over EC2 for simplicity
RDS PostgreSQL (managed) over embedding DB in container
Ollama EC2 or Bedrock — both detailed, your choice
REST API instead of CLI for broader usability
Optimized for development/low-traffic (<100 req/day)
Further Considerations
Ollama Performance: CPU (t3.xlarge, ~$30/mo, 5-30s latency) vs GPU (g4dn.xlarge, ~$100+/mo, 0.5-5s latency) — which latency is acceptable?
Database HA: Single-AZ (dev, cheaper) vs Multi-AZ (prod, resilient) — start simple?
Cost: Enable Spot instances for 70% savings on Fargate (acceptable for dev)?
Document Updates: Static reference docs or frequently changing? Affects seeding strategy.